      "id": "claim_80bef60686a640d987007e1999345072",
      "statement": "The Catalog app depends only on the three ports ContentStore, SkillValidator and FactStore, and serves reads from a single immutable in-memory IndexSnapshot that each build replaces wholesale; archive-cache work uses a separate _archive_lock so it never contends with the snapshot lock.",
